{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":49,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主的僕人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["眾海島啊，聽我說！",{"text":"遠方的列邦啊，要留心聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還沒有出生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華就呼召我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還沒有離開母腹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂就提及我的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使我的口像利劍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用祂的手蔭庇我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使我成為磨亮的箭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我藏在祂的箭囊中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂對我說：「以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要藉著你彰顯我的榮耀。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我說：「我虛耗精力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"徒勞無功。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，耶和華必公正地待我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的報酬在我的上帝那裡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"我在母腹之中，耶和華便塑造我做祂的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫我帶領雅各歸向祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把以色列人召集到祂那裡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在耶和華眼中是尊貴的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝是我的力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂對我說：「我不單單只是讓你做我的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去復興雅各的眾支派，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列得保全的人重歸故土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還要使你成為外族人的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好把我的救恩帶到地極。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的救贖主和聖者耶和華對受藐視、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被本國人憎恨、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭官長奴役的那位說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「因著信實的耶和華——揀選你的以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王一見你必肅然起立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領一見你必俯伏下拜。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的復興"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「在悅納的時候，我應允了你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在拯救的日子，我幫助了你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要保護你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你做我跟民眾立約的中保，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"復興這片土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"分配荒涼的產業。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要對被囚禁的人說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『出來吧！』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要對黑暗中的人說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『你們自由了。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在路上必有吃的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光禿的山嶺上必有食物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不再饑渴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再被熱風和烈日灼傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為憐憫他們的那位必引導他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領他們到泉水邊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我的群山變為通途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修築我的大路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，他們必從遠方來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有的來自北方，有的來自西方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"還有的來自希尼","poem":1},{"noteId":21},{"text":"。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"諸天啊，要歡呼！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地啊，要快樂！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山啊，要歌唱！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華安慰祂的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憐憫祂受苦的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"但錫安說：「耶和華撇棄了我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主把我忘了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「母親豈能忘記自己吃奶的嬰兒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不憐憫自己親生的孩子？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就算有母親忘記，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不會忘記你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我已經把你銘刻在我的手掌上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的牆垣時刻在我的看顧之下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兒女必很快回來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅和破壞你的必離你而去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舉目四下看看吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兒女正聚集到你這裡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憑我的永恆起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必把他們作為飾物戴在身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如新娘一樣用他們妝扮自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「你那荒廢、淒涼、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭到毀壞之地現在必容不下你的居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些吞滅你的人必遠遠地離開你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你流亡期間所生的子女必在你耳邊說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『這地方太小了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再給我們一些地方住吧。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你會在心裡問，『我喪失了兒女、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再生育，流亡在外，漂流不定，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰給我生了這些兒女？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰把他們養大？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我孤身留下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們是從哪裡來的？』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，我必向列國招手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向萬民豎立我的旗幟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必抱著你的兒子、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背著你的女兒回來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列王必做你的養父，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王后必做你的乳母。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必向你俯伏下拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舔你腳上的塵土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時你便知道我是耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仰望我的必不致羞愧。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"勇士搶去的能奪回來嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴君擄走的能救回來嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「勇士擄去的必被奪回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴君搶去的必被救出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必與你的對頭作對，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救你的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使那些欺壓你的人吞吃自己的肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝自己的血喝得酩酊大醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像喝酒一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時候，世人都必知道我耶和華是你的救主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你的救贖主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是雅各的大能者。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":21,"caller":"+","text":"「希尼」可能指遙遠的東方或南方某地。","reference":{"chapter":49,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/49.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/50.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/48.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}